  "id": "garlic-bread",
  "name": "Garlic Bread",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, savory loaf with Parmesan and garlic",
  "description": "Split Italian bread is spread with a creamy Parmesan-garlic mixture, then cooked until golden and rested briefly before serving.",
